  {
   "id": "wax-heads-298453@major-2026-07-31",
   "gameId": "wax-heads-298453",
   "displayName": "Deck The Store In Style With The Wax Heads Cosmetic Update!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-07-31T15:15:00.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Hello Wax Heads!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Our 'Cosmetic Update' is live, bringing a bunch of new stuff to collect, showcase and scatter around Repeater Records. From new shelf displays to virtual pets, posters and more to help put your own stamp on the store.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "New Toys To Display!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Glorf (Discontinued) Toys",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44982268/951ac3eaf14f93a34eab737be07818744c6260ae.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Glorf! The popular kids TV show has released many toys over the years, but nothing like this rare line of discontinued oddities.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Music BeatHeadz",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44982268/7f7b52f81821c236aaea1558d0271e16db48cb0b.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Collector items of The Music BeatHeadz, the lovable characters from TV Sitcom “Why Am I Seeing Music?”",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Poppin' New Promo Posters",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hammerzilla Promo Poster",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44982268/a3b548149fc1e8166ffed144931633e9266405de.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Stolen from the Hammerzilla film premiere at Wizard Shack’s Scream and Screens.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Roberta D Promo Poster",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44982268/40b9ca11e659cfe1d5e5fe4ffdc936471042509e.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "A limited edition poster promotion to celebrate Roberta D’s “Eyelicious” EP.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Limited Edition Plushies",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hammerzilla Plushie",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44982268/a19b030e3a4c5b2d8f220bcaec3a51b7df91ae35.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Got kids who are too young to watch Hammerzilla? Why not get them an adorable Hammerzilla plushie instead!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "My Lil' Mimi",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44982268/11792d53a600f9cda090af510b50b7f4451afcc4.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "That’s right, you can now have pop royalty in your own home, with “My Lil Mimi”!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Fresh New Threads",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Roberta D Life Sacks",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44982268/5c2e0fa5982ec89c2d587230aadb840a691749d2.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "A woman of many talents, Roberta D unleashes her new clothing line that embraces both life and death.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Pal Around With New Virtual Pets",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Glorf-tek",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44982268/0cee08244824aef444075155309281b4000a5e33.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Free digital toy that comes with every Glorfy-yum-yum-meal you purchase, in celebration of Glorf!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Hot-Dawg Destroyer",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44982268/40add49757731e630b183926e82acba2a5835451.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Novelty Hotdog Kaiju virtual pet toy, for fans of hotdogs, dancing and destruction.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Ned!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44982268/610636b0d8ff8ab562d6d3b109a4830a806b593a.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Ned. The only virtual pet you’ll never need again.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Boutique Posters By Dazeray",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Boutique art posters of the hottest bands, designed by the artistic duo Dazeray.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44982268/98111e59bc9d38e29446d4f5fc0510b28928a922.png\"][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44982268/b7a1784575b118e406e63c96f930b87bfb5845f6.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "And last but not least - Dave Demon the Desk Assistant!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44982268/7083b0843066a3a13a9c6eb97cad897cb39e26a6.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Every Repeater Record’s employee needs a desk assistant, so why not make yours the cursed demon, Dave.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Keep on spinning.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Patattie Games & Curve Games",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
